  unitName: Drake Armor Klaus
  unitId: 20734
  unitNumber: 1239
  description: A god from another world with advanced mechanical technology. A long
    war between gods raged across his world, and he took the side that viewed humans
    as unnecessary. At one point, he attempted to work with the gods of another faction
    in order to eliminate the gods that protect humanity. It was a hasty partnership,
    but surprisingly successful in harrying their enemies. However, immediately afterwards,
    a rival deity activated their trump card, "a weapon of mass destruction that
    surpassed the gods." This resulted in a reversal, and the destruction of Klaus's
    faction.
  summonDesc: Humans, ruling the gods? <br>Lowly Summoner from another world...<br>I
    will only<br>follow you<br>for this brief moment.
  fusionDesc: Attempting to win me over? <br>Do not think I will forgive you,<br>no
    matter what gifts you bring me.
